# Abrupt Decay can't be countered, but Aven Interrupter doesn't counter it: it exiles it (ruling 2024-04-12). Bot2 aims the
# Decay at one of Bot1's Mox Pearls; Bot1 flashes in Aven in response and the Decay is exiled (plotted) instead of
# resolving, so all three Pearls are still on the battlefield.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl x3
Aven Interrupter
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Abrupt Decay
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Abrupt Decay.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Aven Interrupter.Cast
[Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Abrupt Decay
Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Aven Interrupter; Mox Pearl; Mox Pearl; Mox Pearl
